# Zanzibar Heavenly — Project Rules

## Overview
Marketing website for Zanzibar Heavenly, a boutique Zanzibar tourism company run by Kassim. The site showcases tours, multi-day expeditions, and accommodation, converting visitors into booking enquiries via WhatsApp and a web form powered by Resend.

## Tech Stack
- **Framework:** Next.js 16 (App Router) with TypeScript
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS v4 using `@theme` directive for CSS variables
- **Fonts:** DM Sans (headings via `--font-heading`), Inter (body via `--font-body`) — loaded via `next/font/google`
- **Animations:** Framer Motion (FadeIn, Stagger, ParallaxImage components in `src/components/ui/Motion.tsx`)
- **Smooth scroll:** Lenis
- **Email:** Resend API (no SDK — uses raw fetch in `src/app/api/enquiry/route.ts`)
- **Deployment:** Vercel at zanzibarheavenly.com
- **Static generation:** SSG with `generateStaticParams` for all content pages

## Colour Palette
- **Teal:** #2f6f73 (primary brand colour, CTAs, headings)
- **Coral:** #e86f51 (accent)
- **Saffron:** #e2a94b (warm accent)
- **Warm White:** #f7f6f2 (page background)
- **Sand:** #f0eee8 (card backgrounds, sections)
- **Ink:** #1a1a1a (text)
- **Palm:** #3f7d6a (secondary green)

## Content Architecture
- All tour/expedition/accommodation/guide content lives in JSON files under `/content`
- Content is read at build time via helpers in `src/lib/content.ts`
- Currency is EUR throughout
- WhatsApp number: +255 682 490 734
- Contact email: info@zanzibarheavenly.com

## Key Directories
```
src/
├── app/                    # Next.js App Router pages
│   ├── tours/[slug]/       # Individual tour pages
│   ├── expeditions/[slug]/ # Individual expedition pages
│   ├── accommodation/[slug]/ # Individual accommodation pages
│   ├── gallery/            # Photo gallery with lightbox
│   ├── guide/[slug]/       # Travel guide articles
│   ├── contact/            # Enquiry form page
│   └── api/enquiry/        # Resend email API route
├── components/
│   ├── layout/             # Header, Footer, WhatsApp floating button
│   ├── sections/           # HeroSection, GalleryGrid, etc.
│   └── ui/                 # EnquiryForm, Motion, ImagePlaceholder, etc.
├── config/site.ts          # Site config (nav, contact, social links)
├── lib/
│   ├── content.ts          # Content loading helpers
│   ├── types.ts            # TypeScript types
│   └── utils.ts            # formatPrice, cn, etc.
content/
├── tours/                  # Tour JSON files
├── expeditions/            # Expedition JSON files
├── accommodation/          # Accommodation JSON files
└── guides/                 # Guide article JSON files
```

## Design Patterns
- **Editorial/luxury tourism aesthetic** — clean, spacious, warm
- Cards use `bg-white` with `border border-border rounded-xl shadow-sm`
- Section labels: `text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-muted`
- CTAs: rounded-full buttons with `tracking-[0.12em] uppercase`
- Primary CTA: `bg-teal text-white`, Secondary: `border border-teal text-teal`
- Sidebar cards on detail pages are sticky (`sticky top-24`)
- Hero sections use `ImagePlaceholder` with gradient overlay
- Use `FadeIn` from Motion.tsx for scroll-triggered animations

## Important Notes
- Images in `/public/images/` have spaces in filenames — use `%20` encoding in src attributes
- Remote images from Unsplash are allowed via `next.config.ts` remotePatterns
- The enquiry form has honeypot spam protection and rate limiting
- Environment variables needed: `RESEND_API_KEY`, `CONTACT_EMAIL`, optionally `RESEND_FROM_EMAIL`
- Do NOT change the WhatsApp number or email without asking
